1
00:00:00,367 --> 00:00:04,287
(Sheldon:)Mom, I want to apologize
for my behavior last night.

2
00:00:04,454 --> 00:00:05,584
(Mrs Cooper:)Apology accepted.

3
00:00:05,747 --> 00:00:08,627
Great. Now, you're gonna love
the Perlmutter lecture.

4
00:00:08,792 --> 00:00:12,422
(Sheldon:)Look, he will be stating that the universe
is older than 6000 years...

5
00:00:12,587 --> 00:00:15,047
...but you could stick
your fingers in your ears...

6
00:00:15,215 --> 00:00:17,755
...and hum "Amazing Grace"
during those parts.

7
00:00:17,926 --> 00:00:20,466
(Mrs Cooper:)I am still going out with your friends.

8
00:00:20,887 --> 00:00:22,727
(Sheldon:)But I apologized.

9
00:00:22,889 --> 00:00:26,809
(Sheldon:)And that was hard for me
because I didn't do anything wrong.

10
00:00:28,437 --> 00:00:32,147
(Mrs Cooper:)Shelly, I hung out with you
in enough dusty lecture halls...

11
00:00:32,357 --> 00:00:34,987
(Mrs Cooper:)...while you were growing up.
I wanna go sightseeing.

12
00:00:35,152 --> 00:00:38,822
(Mrs Cooper:)So why don't you have some pancakes,
get dressed and come with us.

13
00:00:38,989 --> 00:00:41,579
(Sheldon:)I'm not going, and you can't make me.

14
00:00:41,742 --> 00:00:45,242
(Mrs Cooper:)You're right, I can't. Have a nice day.

15
00:00:45,412 --> 00:00:48,162
(Sheldon:)Well, I'm going to stand here
until you change your mind.

16
00:00:48,373 --> 00:00:50,163
Then you are gonna stand there
all day.

17
00:00:52,502 --> 00:00:56,752
(Leonard:)I'm just gonna take my bacon grease
and slide over there.

18
00:00:57,799 --> 00:01:00,429
(Sheldon:)I can't believe my own mother
is abandoning me.

